OL,3,GNEWSAShould loud fireworks fizzle out
OL,4,Afor pets' sake?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA riding school owner who had to have a
OL,7,Fhorse put down after it was spooked by
OL,8,Ffireworks is among those backing calls
OL,9,Fto make Bonfire Night quieter.
OL,11,FThe government is considering tighter
OL,12,Frestrictions, which could see the
OL,13,Fmaximum noise of fireworks sold to the
OL,14,Fpublic cut from 120 to 110 decibels.
OL,16,FJoyce Fearn, who has run Bleach Yard
OL,17,FStables in Beverley for almost 60
OL,18,Fyears, was devastated when, two years
OL,19,Fago, Savannah panicked and suffered leg
OL,20,Finjures so severe that she had to be
OL,21,Feuthanised.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
